cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ecdna-bench: A reference FISH imaging resource and benchmarking framework for ecDNA localisation, segmentation and counting"
abstract: >
  ecdna-bench provides a reference resource of 2,986 paired RGB + DAPI FISH
  microscopy images (1,145 with manual ROI masks forming the benchmark subset),
  a unified evaluation framework for ecDNA detection (object / pixel / count
  metrics with OR and AND matching policies), and ecCount, a compact U-Net for
  soft Gaussian heatmap prediction.
